    "image_image_with_text_overlay_jD87x4": {
      "type": "image--image-with-text-overlay",
      "name": "t:sections.image--image-with-text-overlay.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "image_height": "40vw",
        "bg_image_overlay_opacity": 0,
        "parallax": true,
        "title": "At the heart of it — five Ukrainian women.Five unique stories. Five distinct voices.",
        "text": "<p>Re[Sens] created the “Sensitivity & Sensuality” project to capture a moment —a moment when we, as women, allow ourselves not only to act, but to feel. </p><p>At the heart of it — five Ukrainian women.Five unique stories. Five distinct voices. <b>Lala Tarapakina, Dasha Malakhova, Anna Zavalska, Oksana Shavarska, Maryana Holovko</b>. </p><p>Each one — vibrant, authentic, profound.They share how they find balance —between strength and tenderness,composure and softness,outer success and inner calm.</p>",
        "colors": "dark",
        "textPosition": "center",
        "textAlignment": "center",
        "heading--text-size": 26,
        "text--text-size": 18,
